OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,9,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,10,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,11,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,12,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,13,     Gfavourites.
OL,14,G1300FClassical Live
OL,15,     GPianist Daniil Trifonov and
OL,16,     Gtoday's featured conductor, Franz
OL,17,     GWelser-Most, perform Prokofiev's
OL,18,     Gfiendishly difficult and much-
OL,19,     Gloved third piano concerto in a
OL,20,     Grecording from Munich.
