OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from St Davids Cathedral,
OL,6,     Gwith music by Tomkins and Tallis.
OL,7,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,8,     F100
OL,9,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,10,     Gcritic Nate Chinen discuss the
OL,11,     GMiles Davis sound of the 1960s.
OL,12,G1700FIn Tune
OL,13,     GKatie Derham is joined live in
OL,14,     Gstudio by baritone Thomas Hampson
OL,15,     Gand accordionist Ksenija
OL,16,     GSidorova. She also introduces
OL,17,     Glive music from the Linarol
OL,18,     GConsort.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Gfavourites.
