OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gimmersive, nature-inspired
OL,7,     Gsoundtrack for late-night
OL,8,     Glistening, from classical to
OL,9,     Gcontemporary and everything in
OL,10,     Gbetween.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GSoweto Kinch presents more of the
OL,13,     Gbest in jazz, and welcomes
OL,14,     Gtrumpeter Marquis Hill to reflect
OL,15,     Gon the personal impact of Miles
OL,16,     GDavis' in his centenary week.
